	rdfs:isDefinedBy	<http://data.ga-group.nl/ics/gics/2023/> ;
	skos:definition	"Aziende operanti principalmente nell’estrazione del minerale di rame."@it , """Companies involved primarily in copper ore mining and companies that manufacture primary and basic copper products such as rods, tubes, and wires.

This Sub-Industry excludes manufacturers of copper wires used mainly for electrical purposes classified in the Electrical Components & Equipment Sub-Industry under the Industrials Sector."""@en , "Empresas dedicadas principalmente a la extracción de cobre."@es , "Empresas envolvidas principalmente na mineração de cobre."@pt , "Sociétés principalement actives dans l’exploitation minière du minerai de cuivre."@fr , "Unternehmen, die primär im Kupfererzabbau tätig sind."@de , "Компании, основной деятельностью которых является добыча медной руды."@ru , "主に銅鉱石の採掘を行う会社"@ja , "主要从事铜矿开采的公司。"@zh , "主要從事銅礦開採的公司。"@zh-hant , "주로 구리광석 채굴에 관련된 회사."@ko ;
	skos:inScheme	<http://data.ga-group.nl/ics/gics/2023/> ;
	skos:notation	"15104025" ;
