	skos:definition	"Empresas de comércio e outros distribuidores de equipamentos e produtos industriais."@pt , "Empresas dedicadas al comercio y distribución de productos y equipos industriales."@es , "Handels- und andere Vertriebsunternehmen von Industrieausrüstung und -produkten."@de , "Sociétés commerciales et autres distributeurs d’équipements et de produits industriels."@fr , "Società commerciali e altri distributori di attrezzature e prodotti industriali."@it , """Trading companies and distributors of industrial equipment and products.

This Sub-Industry includes distributors of chemicals, construction materials, containers & packaging products, metals & minerals such as coal & ores, paper & forest products, building products and electrical equipment. It also includes lessors of aircraft, railcars and other transportation equipment as well as companies that engage in industrial machinery rental to other businesses.

This Sub-Industry also includes companies distributing or wholesaling industrial equipment and products to other businesses using a proprietary online platform/website."""@en , "Торговые компании и д��угие дистрибьюторы промышленного оборудования и изделий."@ru , "商社および産業設備や製品を取り扱うその他流通業社。"@ja , "貿易公司以及其他工業設備和產品的經銷商。"@zh-hant , "贸易公司以及其它工业设备和产品的经销商。"@zh , "산업용 장비와 제품의 무역 회사 및 기타 판매업체."@ko ;
	skos:inScheme	<http://data.ga-group.nl/ics/gics/2023/> ;
	skos:notation	"20107010" ;
	skos:prefLabel	"Comercio y Distribución"@es , "Empresas de Comércio e Distribuidores"@pt , "Handels- und Vertriebsunternehmen"@de , "Sociétés commerciales et distributeurs commerciaux"@fr , "Società commerciali e distributori"@it , "Trading Companies & Distributors"@en , "Торговые компании и дистрибьюторы"@ru , "商社・流通業"@ja , "貿易公司與經銷商"@zh-hant , "贸易公司与经销商"@zh , "무역 회사와 판매업체"@ko ;
	tempo:validFrom	"2023-03-18"^^xsd:date .

