	rdfs:isDefinedBy	<http://data.ga-group.nl/ics/gics/2023/> ;
	skos:definition	"Inhaber und Betreiber von Health Maintenance Organizations (HMOs) und anderen privaten Versorgungsmodellen."@de , "Owners and operators of Health Maintenance Organizations (HMOs) and other managed plans. These companies derive premium revenues from risk-based health insurance arrangements and include Preferred Provider Organizations (PPOs), Consumer Driven Health Plans (CDHPs), Health Maintenance Organizations (HMOs) and Point-of-Service (POS) plans. It also includes health and dental benefit plans."@en , "Propietarios y operadores de empresas de seguros médicos y otros servicios de salud."@es , "Propriétaires et gérants d’organismes d’assurance maladie de type HMO (Health Maintenance Organization) et d’organismes similaires."@fr , "Proprietários e operadores de Organizações de Manutenção de Saúde (HMO) e outros planos administrados."@pt , "Proprietari e gestori di casse mutue malattie (Health Maintenance Organizations, HMO) e altri piani gestiti."@it , "Компании, реализующие страховые медицинские программы и прочие программы медицинского обеспечения."@ru , "保険維持機構（HMO)や他の管理医療型プランを提供する業者。"@ja , "健康維護組織（HMO）以及其他管理式計劃的東主及營運商。"@zh-hant , "健康维护组织（HMOs）的业主和运营商，以及其它管理型计划。"@zh , "종합 헬스케어 기관(HMO) 및 기타 헬스케어 관리 플랜의 소유자와 운영자."@ko ;
	skos:inScheme	<http://data.ga-group.nl/ics/gics/2023/> ;
	skos:notation	"35102030" ;
	skos:prefLabel	"Administración de Salud"@es , "Assistência Médica Administrada"@pt , "Assurance maladie"@fr , "Managed Health Care"@en , "Sanità gestita"@it , "Verwaltete Gesundheitsfürsorge"@de , "Управляемое здравоохранение"@ru , "管理健康医療"@ja , "管理型保健护理"@zh , "管理式醫療保健"@zh-hant , "헬스케어 관리"@ko ;
	tempo:validFrom	"2023-03-18"^^xsd:date .

