	skos:definition	"Editores de jornais, revistas e livros, e provedores de informações em forma impressa ou em formato eletrônico."@pt , """Publishers of newspapers, magazines and books in print or electronic formats.

This Sub-Industry includes publishers of financial journals, magazines, and websites, which do not provide financial data, pricing or ratings information to financial service companies."""@en , "印刷或电子格式的报纸，杂志和书籍的出版商。"@zh , "新聞、雑誌、書籍の出版会社、および印刷・電子形式での情報提供業者。"@ja , "신문, 잡지, 책 등을 인쇄물 또는 전자문서 형식으로 제공하는 출판업체"@ko ;
