	rdfs:isDefinedBy	<http://data.ga-group.nl/ics/gics/2023/> ;
	skos:definition	"""Companies that produce or distribute electricity, including both nuclear and non-nuclear facilities.

This Sub-Industry includes companies that are vertically integrated across electricity generation and distribution chain, but whose primary business focus is on the distribution of electricity to the end users. It also includes electricity transmission & distribution companies."""@en , "Empresas dedicadas a la generación o distribución de electricidad. Se incluyen tanto las centrales nucleares como las no nucleares."@es , "Empresas que produzem ou distribuem eletricidade. Inclui instalações nucleares e não nucleares."@pt , "发电和配电公司。包括核子及非核子设施。"@zh , "電気を製造または供給する会社。原子力施設、非原子力施設の両方を含��。"@ja , "전기를 생산 또는 배급하는 회사. 핵 및 비핵 시설 모두 포함."@ko ;
	skos:inScheme	<http://data.ga-group.nl/ics/gics/2023/> ;
	skos:notation	"55101010" ;
	skos:prefLabel	"Electric Utilities"@en , "Serviços de Eletricidade"@pt , "Suministro Eléctrico"@es , "电力公用事业"@zh , "電力"@ja , "전기 유틸리티"@ko ;
	tempo:validFrom	"2023-03-18"^^xsd:date .

