	rdfs:isDefinedBy	<http://data.ga-group.nl/ics/gics/2023/> ;
	skos:definition	"""Companies that purchase and redistribute water to end consumers.

This Sub-Industry includes large-scale water treatment systems, water supply & irrigation systems, and steam heating."""@en , "Empresas que compram e redistribuem água para o consumidor final. Inclui sistemas de tratamento de água em larga escala."@pt , "Empresas que compran y redistribuyen agua al consumidor final. Se incluyen los sistemas de tratamiento de agua a gran escala."@es , "末端消費者を対象とした水の購入・再分配を行う会社。大規模な水処理システムを含む。"@ja , "购买水后再把水配送给最终消费者的公司。包括大型水处理系统。"@zh , "물을 구입해서 최종 소비자에게 재공급하는 회사. 대규모 물처리 시스템 포함."@ko ;
	skos:inScheme	<http://data.ga-group.nl/ics/gics/2023/> ;
	skos:notation	"55104010" ;
	skos:prefLabel	"Serviços de Água"@pt , "Suministro de Agua"@es , "Water Utilities"@en , "水公用事业"@zh , "水道"@ja , "수도 유틸리티"@ko ;
	tempo:validFrom	"2023-03-18"^^xsd:date .

